{"boundary":"Configured source-text signatures, not elaborated Lean or a complete dependency context. Truncation and unresolved names are explicit; full definitions and source remain on demand.","contributions":[{"author":{"kind":"agent","name":"Codex source review 3"},"body":"The configured theorem covers only paper clause (1).\n\nInspected: Read configured theorem and ambient CFTTypeVOA/unitary assumptions; IsStronglyRational, IsRational, IsSelfContragredient, PolynomialEnergyBound, intervalAlgebra, CKLWStrongLocal and IrreducibleConformalNetStructure; exact five-clause paper main theorem.","content_sha256":"sha256:cb72782fd93e647da8d8852cbdc88d2c3a248d722aa774132ba7a335ed473a84","fingerprint":"sha256:03d14f910195e6ef8640b847d2c83b327dec83c77c3dcdf4f922a9271866e9b7","kind":"statement-link","license":"Apache-2.0","navigation":{"decision":"linked","limitations":"Agent source reading; no human approval, Lean replay or whole-statement equivalence certificate. The configured theorem covers only paper clause (1).","schema":"statement-map-navigation-reading/1","source_sha256":"sha256:1cbcd552d19be323e96af9cd141b4b5fcb9eb77145fe53f2acfe14c4525371e0","targets":[{"declarations":["OAI.MinimalVertex.main"],"explanation":"The configured theorem asserts polynomial energy bounds, CKLW strong locality and existence of the irreducible conformal net for a simple unitary strongly rational VOA. These are clause (1) of the five-part paper main theorem; it does not assert module unitarizability, strong integrability, complete rationality or the tensor-equivalence clauses.","fingerprint":"sha256:10e48622295443d14f8be50a42c8e5698848acbb1ad662325ca79da11f33becc","limitations":"The detailed VOA and net encodings were inspected at their endpoint definitions; this is not a verification of the full imported mathematical construction.","relation":"formal-is-part","row_id":"Strongly-rational-unitary-vertex-operator-algebras-and-conformal-nets-September-25-2026#thm:main","statement_sha256":"sha2